// requeue is Go's goschedImpl, for a yield, a preemption, and a green thread whose thread lost its processor in a blocking
// call: the green thread goes to the global run queue, and a thread is woken for an idle processor. One that a ready made
// notified while it ran stays so on the queue and when it runs again: it may have read its condition before the ready and
// be about to park on it, which only the permit then ends.
